            <SPEC-HIERARCHY IDENTIFIER="SH-007" LAST-CHANGE="2026-10-06T09:00:00Z"><OBJECT><SPEC-OBJECT-REF>SO-GSR-REQ-007</SPEC-OBJECT-REF></OBJECT></SPEC-HIERARCHY>
